{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日美「利劍」聯合演習今日展開。</p><p></p><p>美軍航母羅斯福號，同日駛離日本橫須賀基地，前往參加演習。這次聯合演習將持續至29日，在日本各地舉行，日美雙方共約6萬兵力參加。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.CARRIER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Tnf4PavTL11792415706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>日本傳媒報道，由於有駐日美軍涉嫌劫殺一名沖繩女子，日本防衛省已要求美軍，在演習期間盡量減少官兵外出。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:52.519559+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:51.836738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:37.241316+00:00","content_hash":"b4d0230529351fa0470a7c1bc59e276bc51cca3b78bf0d7ddb5069cf29f3c679","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}